This directory contains a filtered and pre-processed subset of the
Endless Terminals dataset.

  Upstream paper : "Endless Terminals: Scaling RL Environments for
                    Terminal Agents" (arXiv:2601.16443)
  Upstream repo  : https://github.com/kanishkg/endless-terminals
  Dataset source : https://huggingface.co/datasets/obiwan96/endless-terminals
  License        : MIT (as declared on the Hugging Face dataset page)

The original dataset ships ~2500 container-based terminal tasks
(one Dockerfile + instruction + tests + reference solution each). This
copy contains only the 1489 tasks admitted by the task's validation
gate (et/build_dataset.py), reduced to the four files the training
runtime consumes (setup.sh, instruction.md, test_final_state.py,
test_initial_state.py), with Dockerfiles transpiled to setup.sh by the
upstream task code. Splits (train/val/test) were produced with a fixed
seed; see splits.json and validation_report.json in this directory.
